## Implementation notes (code)

When wiring approved copy in `data/productPdpContent.ts` or related schema/FAQ/alt files:

- Change only what the user scoped (e.g. intro paragraphs only unless they ask for bullets/FAQ/schema).
- Do not change pricing, checkout, image loading, or product functionality unless explicitly requested.
- Preserve existing schema structure; enrich copy within approved fields only.
